        "title": "Ray Tracing",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Ray tracing is the image-order strategy: for each pixel, shoot a ray from the eye into the\nscene, find the nearest surface it hits, and ask what light leaves that surface toward the\neye. Reflections, refractions, and shadows fall out by *recursively shooting more rays*."
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RAY-TRACING.md#003",
      "path": [
        "03-RAY-TRACING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:computer-graphics:03-ray-tracing, git-history:computer-graphics:03-ray-tracing]",
        "canonical_path": "computer-graphics/03-RAY-TRACING.md",
        "concepts": "[ray-surface intersection, whitted ray tracing, path tracing, BVH, kd-tree, monte carlo]",
        "current_path": "computer-graphics/03-RAY-TRACING.md",
        "id": "maxim:computer-graphics:ray-tracing",
        "index_roles": "[guide]",
        "kind": "guide",
        "maxim_schema": "maxim.frontmatter.v1",
        "module": "computer-graphics",
        "remap_from": "[]",
        "remap_to": "[]",
        "root_concepts": "[ray tracing]",
        "section": "computer-graphics",
        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Ray Tracing",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n|                         THE RAY TRACING LOOP (per pixel)                             |\n|                                                                                      |\n|  CAMERA          TRAVERSE         INTERSECT        SHADE           RECURSE           |\n|  RAY GEN         ACCEL STRUCT     PRIMITIVE        HIT POINT       (spawn rays)      |\n|                                                                                      |\n|  eye -> pixel -> descend BVH  -> ray vs triangle -> evaluate   -> shadow rays  -> +  |\n|  build ray      skip empty/      (Moller-          BRDF + lights    reflection       |\n|  (o, d)         far boxes         Trumbore)         at hit point     refraction      |\n|                                                                      bounce ray      |\n|                                                                                      |\n|   [ray gen]     [BVH/kd  L3]      [intersect L2]    [shade L1+04]   [recurse L4]     |\n+--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+\n```"
    },
    {
      "id": "03-RAY-TRACING.md#004",
      "path": [
        "03-RAY-TRACING.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
      "metadata": {
        "backsource_ids": "[proof-backfill:computer-graphics:03-ray-tracing, git-history:computer-graphics:03-ray-tracing]",
